desktopManager.js dated 2022-06-28.

This is an unofficial modified copy. The modifications are in
desktopManager.js and desktopGrid.js: images dropped on the desktop are
downloaded from Firefox's image URL instead of delegated to Nautilus.
See patch/. Verified against Firefox ESR 153.6 on GNOME Shell 42.9.

